  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9s5g67w4ts_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://github.com/2noise/ChatTTS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/2noise/ChatTTS</a> 12.6K 的 Star 了，这应该是我看到过增长最快的一个开源项目。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9s5g67w4ts_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>给大家看个数据，从注册到付费，从免费试用第一次到付费的间隔时间。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9s5g67w4ts_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9s5g67w4ts_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>又一个开源AI搜索，还是YC投资的团队，不过好像刷Star了。<a href=\"https://github.com/OcularEngineering/ocular\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/OcularEngineering/ocular</a></div>\n<div>牛</div>\n<div>作者是咱们的人</div>\n<div>的确整理得很好</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9s5g67w4ts_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9s5g67w4ts_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>AI生成6K壁纸下载站 <a href=\"https://www.background.supply/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.background.supply/</a></div>",
